        "notes": "Bangladeshi (construction workers); Vietnamese; Japanese (legacy community, Japanese period 1914-44, Japanese population once exceeded Palauans, cultural influences remain: food, words, customs)"
      },
      {
        "name": "Other",
        "percentage": 4.4,
        "notes": "Carolinian (outer island Micronesians, Sonsorolese/Tobian, distinct cultures); American (military, advisors); Micronesian (Chuukese, Yapese); European; mixed heritage common"
      }
